        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml Sada_Use_Case\nleft to right direction\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam nodesep 20\nskinparam ranksep 30\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam usecase {\n  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC\n  BorderColor #334155\n  ArrowColor #475569\n  FontSize 11\n}\nskinparam actor {\n  BackgroundColor #F1F5F9\n  BorderColor #334155\n  FontSize 11\n}\n\n&#39; الفاعلون الأساسيون (الجهة اليسرى)\nactor \&quot;Customer\&quot; as Customer\nactor \&quot;Review Employee\&quot; as Reviewer\nactor \&quot;System Administrator\&quot; as Admin\nactor \&quot;AI Researcher\&quot; as Researcher\n\n&#39; الفاعل الثانوي (الجهة اليمنى)\nactor \&quot;Sada AI Service\&quot; as AI\n\nrectangle \&quot;&lt;b&gt;Sada Digital Banking Platform&lt;/b&gt;\\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\&quot; {\n\n  &#39; --- 1. Customer Services ---\n  usecase \&quot;Register Customer Account\&quot; as Register\n  usecase \&quot;Open Bank Account\&quot; as OpenAccount\n  usecase \&quot;Authenticate User Session\&quot; as Auth\n  usecase \&quot;View Account Summary\&quot; as View\n  usecase \&quot;Execute Internal Transfer\&quot; as UC1\n  usecase \&quot;Verify OTP Challenge\&quot; as OTP\n  usecase \&quot;Check Available Balance\&quot; as Balance\n  usecase \&quot;Check Daily Transfer Limit\&quot; as Limit\n  usecase \&quot;Evaluate Transaction Risk\&quot; as Risk\n  usecase \&quot;Post Double-Entry Ledger\&quot; as Post\n  usecase \&quot;Hold Suspicious Transaction\&quot; as Hold\n  usecase \&quot;Open Review Case\&quot; as OpenCase\n  usecase \&quot;Submit Sensitive Support Request\&quot; as UC2\n  usecase \&quot;Create Support Ticket\&quot; as Ticket\n  usecase \&quot;Attach Voice Recording\&quot; as Attach\n\n  &#39; --- 2. Audio Assessment ---\n  usecase \&quot;Analyze Audio Recording\&quot; as UC3\n  usecase \&quot;Validate Audio File\&quot; as Validate\n  usecase \&quot;Assess Audio Quality\&quot; as Quality\n  usecase \&quot;Preprocess Audio Signal\&quot; as Prep\n  usecase \&quot;Compute Spoof Score\&quot; as Score\n  usecase \&quot;Store Assessment Metadata\&quot; as Metadata\n  usecase \&quot;Delete AI Scratch File\&quot; as Scratch\n  usecase \&quot;Evaluate Audio Risk\&quot; as AudioRisk\n\n  &#39; --- 3. Case and Ledger Operations ---\n  usecase \&quot;Review Suspicious Case\&quot; as UC4\n  usecase \&quot;Inspect Case Details\&quot; as Inspect\n  usecase \&quot;Listen to Retained Recording\&quot; as Listen\n  usecase \&quot;Record Review Decision\&quot; as Decision\n  usecase \&quot;Complete Held Transfer\&quot; as Complete\n  usecase \&quot;Cancel Held Transfer\&quot; as Cancel\n  usecase \&quot;Reverse Ledger Transaction\&quot; as Reverse\n  usecase \&quot;Append Audit Event\&quot; as Audit\n\n  &#39; --- 4. Administration and Research ---\n  usecase \&quot;Manage User Accounts\&quot; as Users\n  usecase \&quot;Assign User Role\&quot; as Roles\n  usecase \&quot;Configure Risk Threshold\&quot; as Threshold\n  usecase \&quot;Configure Transfer Limit\&quot; as TransferLimit\n  usecase \&quot;View Audit Log\&quot; as AuditView\n  usecase \&quot;View Operational Reports\&quot; as Reports\n  usecase \&quot;Export Evaluation Metrics\&quot; as Metrics\n}\n\n&#39; روابط الفاعلين الأساسيين (اليسار)\nCustomer -- Register\nCustomer -- OpenAccount\nCustomer -- View\nCustomer -- UC1\nCustomer -- UC2\n\nReviewer -- UC4\nReviewer -- Reverse\n\nAdmin -- Users\nAdmin -- Roles\nAdmin -- Threshold\nAdmin -- TransferLimit\nAdmin -- AuditView\nAdmin -- Reports\n\nResearcher -- Metrics\n\n&#39; علاقات خدمات العميل والتحويل الداخلي (UC-01)\nView ..&gt; Auth : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC1 ..&gt; Auth : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC1 ..&gt; OTP : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC1 ..&gt; Balance : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC1 ..&gt; Limit : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC1 ..&gt; Risk : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nPost ..&gt; UC1 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\\n[risk decision = PASS]\nHold ..&gt; UC1 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\\n[manual review required]\nHold ..&gt; OpenCase : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nPost ..&gt; Audit : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nHold ..&gt; Audit : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; علاقات طلب الدعم الحساس وفحص الصوت (UC-02 &amp; UC-03)\nUC2 ..&gt; Auth : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC2 ..&gt; Ticket : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC2 ..&gt; Attach : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC2 ..&gt; UC3 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC2 ..&gt; AudioRisk : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nOpenCase ..&gt; AudioRisk : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\\n[risk policy requires review]\n\nUC3 --&gt; AI\nUC3 ..&gt; Validate : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC3 ..&gt; Quality : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nPrep ..&gt; UC3 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\\n[audio quality sufficient]\nPrep ..&gt; Score : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC3 ..&gt; Metadata : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC3 ..&gt; Scratch : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; علاقات مراجعة الحالات والقيود المحاسبية (UC-04)\nUC4 ..&gt; Auth : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC4 ..&gt; Inspect : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nListen ..&gt; Inspect : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\\n[retained recording available]\nUC4 ..&gt; Decision : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nComplete ..&gt; Decision : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\\n[accepted case has held transfer]\nCancel ..&gt; Decision : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\\n[rejected case has held transfer]\nDecision ..&gt; Audit : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nComplete ..&gt; Audit : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nCancel ..&gt; Audit : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nReverse ..&gt; Audit : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="3XM052n9Bf0rAu2ZNSKN-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
